                            Leistiman.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-08-28"><hi rendition="#italic">August 28,
                        1903</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Loomis states that the United States European Squadron has been ordered to
                    Beirut.)</p>
